expression: out
---
Date/time format conversion (unix / ISO 8601 / RFC 2822)

Usage: ubertool date [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  convert  Convert between date/time formats
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Output as JSON to stdout. Human messages still go to stderr
  -q, --quiet    Bare values only (pipe-friendly)
  -v, --verbose  Verbose progress to stderr
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
